Package: netmapper
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Netmapper Contributors <netmapper@example.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC_VERSION@)
Description: concurrent TCP and UDP scanner for authorized network inventory
 Netmapper resolves IP addresses, CIDR networks, and DNS names, then reports
 TCP and UDP port states using bounded probes and optional TCP banner detection.